  first | exact @GlobalTheory.Poinc.Sep.FrameInt.kap_of_generic | exact GlobalTheory.Poinc.Sep.FrameInt.kap_of_generic | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.Poinc.Sep.FrameInt.kap_of_generic <;> assumption)
